ngs. So we must escape newlines as \\n. So each line break should be \\n. Also the indentation spaces are fine.\n\nLet me write the escaped version manually. I'll take the code string and apply escaping:\n\nOriginal code (as a single string with \\n for newlines):\n\n\"from collections import deque\\n\\ndef solve(case):\\n    if not isinstance(case, dict):\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"case must be a dict\\\")\\n    payload = case.get(\\\"payload\\\")\\n    if not isinstance(payload, dict):\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"missing payload\\\")\\n    nodes = payload.get(\\\"nodes\\\")\\n    if not isinstance(nodes, list) or len(nodes) == 0:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"nodes missing or empty\\\")\\n    threshold = payload.get(\\\"utility_threshold\\\")\\n    if threshold is None:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"utility_threshold missing\\\")\\n    node_map = {}\\n    children = {}\\n    for n in nodes:\\n        if not isinstance(n, dict):\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"node not dict\\\")\\n        nid = n.get(\\\"id\\\")\\n        if not isinstance(nid, str) or not nid:\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"invalid node id\\\")\\n        parent = n.get(\\\"parent\\\")\\n        if parent is not None and not isinstance(parent, str):\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"invalid parent\\\")\\n        if \\\"depth\\\" not in n or not isinstance(n[\\\"depth\\\"], int):\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"missing depth\\\")\\n        if \\\"removable\\\" not in n or not isinstance(n[\\\"removable\\\"], bool):\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"missing removable\\\")\\n        if \\\"utility\\\" not in n or not isinstance(n[\\\"utility\\\"], (int, float)):\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"missing utility\\\")\\n        if nid in node_map:\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"duplicate id\\\")\\n        node_map[nid] = n\\n        children.setdefault(parent, []).append(nid)\\n    root_ids = [nid for nid, n in node_map.items() if n[\\\"parent\\\"] is None]\\n    if len(root_id